{"page":42,"verses":[{"verse_key":"2:253","surah":2,"ayah":253,"ar_uthmani":"۞ تِلْكَ ٱلرُّسُلُ فَضَّلْنَا بَعْضَهُمْ عَلَىٰ بَعْضٍ ۘ مِّنْهُم مَّن كَلَّمَ ٱللَّهُ ۖ وَرَفَعَ بَعْضَهُمْ دَرَجَـٰتٍ ۚ وَءَاتَيْنَا عِيسَى ٱبْنَ مَرْيَمَ ٱلْبَيِّنَـٰتِ وَأَيَّدْنَـٰهُ بِرُوحِ ٱلْقُدُسِ ۗ وَلَوْ شَآءَ ٱللَّهُ مَا ٱقْتَتَلَ ٱلَّذِينَ مِنۢ بَعْدِهِم مِّنۢ بَعْدِ مَا جَآءَتْهُمُ ٱلْبَيِّنَـٰتُ وَلَـٰكِنِ ٱخْتَلَفُوا۟ فَمِنْهُم مَّنْ ءَامَنَ وَمِنْهُم مَّن كَفَرَ ۚ وَلَوْ شَآءَ ٱللَّهُ مَا ٱقْتَتَلُوا۟ وَلَـٰكِنَّ ٱللَّهَ يَفْعَلُ مَا يُرِيدُ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We favoured some of these messengers above others. God spoke to some; others He raised in rank; We gave Jesus, son of Mary, Our clear signs and strengthened him with the holy spirit. If God had so willed, their successors would not have fought each other after they had been brought clear signs. But they disagreed: some believed and some disbelieved. If God had so willed, they would not have fought each other, but God does what He will.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"۞ تِلْكَ","en_gloss":"These","transliteration":"til'ka","verse_key":"2:253"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلرُّسُلُ","en_gloss":"(are) the Messengers","transliteration":"l-rusulu","verse_key":"2:253"},{"pos":3,"ar":"فَضَّلْنَا","en_gloss":"We (have) preferred","transliteration":"faḍḍalnā","verse_key":"2:253"},{"pos":4,"ar":"بَعْضَهُمْ","en_gloss":"some of them","transliteration":"baʿḍahum","verse_key":"2:253"},{"pos":5,"ar":"عَلَىٰ","en_gloss":"over","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"2:253"},{"pos":6,"ar":"بَعْضٍۢ ۘ","en_gloss":"others","transliteration":"baʿḍin","verse_key":"2:253"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مِّنْهُم","en_gloss":"Among them","transliteration":"min'hum","verse_key":"2:253"},{"pos":8,"ar":"مَّن","en_gloss":"(were those with) whom","transliteration":"man","verse_key":"2:253"},{"pos":9,"ar":"كَلَّمَ","en_gloss":"spoke","transliteration":"kallama","verse_key":"2:253"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ ۖ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"2:253"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَرَفَعَ","en_gloss":"and He raised","transliteration":"warafaʿa","verse_key":"2:253"},{"pos":12,"ar":"بَعْضَهُمْ","en_gloss":"some of them","transliteration":"baʿḍahum","verse_key":"2:253"},{"pos":13,"ar":"دَرَجَـٰتٍۢ ۚ","en_gloss":"(in) degrees","transliteration":"darajātin","verse_key":"2:253"},{"pos":14,"ar":"وَءَاتَيْنَا","en_gloss":"And We gave","transliteration":"waātaynā","verse_key":"2:253"},{"pos":15,"ar":"عِيسَى","en_gloss":"Isa","transliteration":"ʿīsā","verse_key":"2:253"},{"pos":16,"ar":"ٱبْنَ","en_gloss":"son","transliteration":"ib'na","verse_key":"2:253"},{"pos":17,"ar":"مَرْيَمَ","en_gloss":"(of) Maryam","transliteration":"maryama","verse_key":"2:253"},{"pos":18,"ar":"ٱلْبَيِّنَـٰتِ","en_gloss":"the clear proofs","transliteration":"l-bayināti","verse_key":"2:253"},{"pos":19,"ar":"وَأَيَّدْنَـٰهُ","en_gloss":"and We supported him","transliteration":"wa-ayyadnāhu","verse_key":"2:253"},{"pos":20,"ar":"بِرُوحِ","en_gloss":"with Spirit","transliteration":"birūḥi","verse_key":"2:253"},{"pos":21,"ar":"ٱلْقُدُسِ ۗ","en_gloss":"[the] Holy","transliteration":"l-qudusi","verse_key":"2:253"},{"pos":22,"ar":"وَلَوْ","en_gloss":"And if","transliteration":"walaw","verse_key":"2:253"},{"pos":23,"ar":"شَآءَ","en_gloss":"(had) willed","transliteration":"shāa","verse_key":"2:253"},{"pos":24,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"2:253"},{"pos":25,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"2:253"},{"pos":26,"ar":"ٱقْتَتَلَ","en_gloss":"(would have) fought each other","transliteration":"iq'tatala","verse_key":"2:253"},{"pos":27,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"2:253"},{"pos":28,"ar":"مِنۢ","en_gloss":"(came) from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"2:253"},{"pos":29,"ar":"بَعْدِهِم","en_gloss":"after them","transliteration":"baʿdihim","verse_key":"2:253"},{"pos":30,"ar":"مِّنۢ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"2:253"},{"