"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"2:253"},{"pos":52,"ar":"يُرِيدُ","en_gloss":"He intends","transliteration":"yurīdu","verse_key":"2:253"},{"pos":53,"ar":"٢٥٣","en_gloss":"(253)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"2:253"}]},{"verse_key":"2:254","surah":2,"ayah":254,"ar_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوٓا۟ أَنفِقُوا۟ مِمَّا رَزَقْنَـٰكُم مِّن قَبْلِ أَن يَأْتِىَ يَوْمٌ لَّا بَيْعٌ فِيهِ وَلَا خُلَّةٌ وَلَا شَفَـٰعَةٌ ۗ وَٱلْكَـٰفِرُونَ هُمُ ٱلظَّـٰلِمُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"You who believe, give from what We have provided for you, before the Day comes when there is no bargaining, no friendship, and no intercession. It is the disbelievers who are wrong.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","en_gloss":"O you","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","verse_key":"2:254"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"2:254"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ءَامَنُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"believe[d]","transliteration":"āmanū","verse_key":"2:254"},{"pos":4,"ar":"أَنفِقُوا۟","en_gloss":"Spend","transliteration":"anfiqū","verse_key":"2:254"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مِمَّا","en_gloss":"of what","transliteration":"mimmā","verse_key":"2:254"},{"pos":6,"ar":"رَزَقْنَـٰكُم","en_gloss":"We (have) provided you","transliteration":"razaqnākum","verse_key":"2:254"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مِّن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"2:254"},{"pos":8,"ar":"قَبْلِ","en_gloss":"before","transliteration":"qabli","verse_key":"2:254"},{"pos":9,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"2:254"},{"pos":10,"ar":"يَأْتِىَ","en_gloss":"comes","transliteration":"yatiya","verse_key":"2:254"},{"pos":11,"ar":"يَوْمٌۭ","en_gloss":"a Day","transliteration":"yawmun","verse_key":"2:254"},{"pos":12,"ar":"لَّا","en_gloss":"no","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"2:254"},{"pos":13,"ar":"بَيْعٌۭ","en_gloss":"bargaining","transliteration":"bayʿun","verse_key":"2:254"},{"pos":14,"ar":"فِيهِ","en_gloss":"in it","transliteration":"fīhi","verse_key":"2:254"},{"pos":15,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"and no","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"2:254"},{"pos":16,"ar":"خُلَّةٌۭ","en_gloss":"friendship","transliteration":"khullatun","verse_key":"2:254"},{"pos":17,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"and no","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"2:254"},{"pos":18,"ar":"شَفَـٰعَةٌۭ ۗ","en_gloss":"intercession","transliteration":"shafāʿatun","verse_key":"2:254"},{"pos":19,"ar":"وَٱلْكَـٰفِرُونَ","en_gloss":"And the deniers ","transliteration":"wal-kāfirūna","verse_key":"2:254"},{"pos":20,"ar":"هُمُ","en_gloss":"they","transliteration":"humu","verse_key":"2:254"},{"pos":21,"ar":"ٱلظَّـٰلِمُونَ","en_gloss":"(are) the wrongdoers","transliteration":"l-ẓālimūna","verse_key":"2:254"},{"pos":22,"ar":"٢٥٤","en_gloss":"(254)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"2:254"}]},{"verse_key":"2:255","surah":2,"ayah":255,"ar_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ لَآ إِلَـٰهَ إِلَّا هُوَ ٱلْحَىُّ ٱلْقَيُّومُ ۚ لَا تَأْخُذُهُۥ سِنَةٌ وَلَا نَوْمٌ ۚ لَّهُۥ مَا فِى ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ وَمَا فِى ٱلْأَرْضِ ۗ مَن ذَا ٱلَّذِى يَشْفَعُ عِندَهُۥٓ إِلَّا بِإِذْنِهِۦ ۚ يَعْلَمُ مَا بَيْنَ أَيْدِيهِمْ وَمَا خَلْفَهُمْ ۖ وَلَا يُحِيطُونَ بِشَىْءٍ مِّنْ عِلْمِهِۦٓ إِلَّا بِمَا شَآءَ ۚ وَسِعَ كُرْسِيُّهُ ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ وَٱلْأَرْضَ ۖ وَلَا يَـُٔودُهُۥ حِفْظُهُمَا ۚ وَهُوَ ٱلْعَلِىُّ ٱلْعَظِيمُ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"God: there is no god but Him, the Ever Living, the Ever Watchful.Neither slumber nor sleep overtakes Him. All that is in the heavens and in the earth belongs to Him. Who is there that can intercede with Him except by His leave? He knows what is before them and what is behind them, but they do not comprehend any of His knowledge except what He wills. His throne extends over the heavens and the earth; it does not weary Him to preserve them both. He is the Most High, the Tremendous.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah ","transliteration":"al-lahu","verse_key":"2:255"},{"pos":2,"ar":"لَآ","en_gloss":"(there is) no","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"2:255"},{"pos":3,"a